Mom smiles on the screen.
I tell her about my evening.
I said, "Mom, today I told my new friends a story."
"I told them about my first day in Mumbai."
"When I came here in January."
Mom listened to me carefully.
There were old memories in her eyes.
She said, "That was a very special day."
"You went so far from home for the first time."
I smiled and said, "Yes, I remember everything."
Mom asked, "Did you tell them about that morning?"
I said, "Yes, I told them about the airport."
Mom became a little emotional.
She lovingly said, "Tell me that story again."
"Tell me about that morning."
"When we said goodbye at the airport."
I was a little surprised.
I asked, "Mom, you were there, why again?"
She smiled and said, "Because I want to see that day through your eyes."
